# kfail: only the failing pods, with events and the crashed container's last logs
Output docs/kfail.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 640
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 70ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='demo $ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "kfail"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Down
Sleep 3s
Down
Sleep 2500ms
Up
Up
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Escape
Sleep 500ms
